Syncthing's Source Code Form is available, unchanged, at the repository and tag
above. build.sh adds this repository's own package (go/droidtopsyncthing,
GPL-3.0-or-later) beside it as cmd/droidtopsyncthing; no file of Syncthing is
changed, so every MPL-2.0 file keeps its own terms. MPL-2.0 permits combining
Syncthing with code under the GPL (MPL-2.0 section 3.3, "Secondary License").

libsyncthing.so also links the Go modules Syncthing's go.mod requires at that
tag, each under its own license (listed in Syncthing's go.mod; among them
mattn/go-sqlite3, which embeds the public-domain SQLite), and the Go standard
library (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors).
